      <div type="clause" n="7">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIEm">III Em</ref> 7</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Et omnis homo credibilis faciat homines suos et omnes qui in pace et terra sua sunt.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And every man shall act as surety for his men and for all those who are under his protection and on his estate.</ab>
